<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94203" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐνά̆μωρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mischievous, hurtful</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλέθρια καὶ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				48
			</span></i>; <i>wantonly mischievous</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anacr.
				52
			</span></i>; of a dog, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.3a
			</span></i>: c. gen. rei, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἑωυτοῦ
			ς</span>. <i>destructive of</i> his own property, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.92
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ́</span>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως, ἐπέδακνεν τὸν Εὐριπίδην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Satyr.
					<u>Vit.Eur.Fr.</u>
					39 xvi 23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wanton</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάτη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					2.38
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.). (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίνομαι</span>: for the
			termin. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μωρος</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰόμωρος</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
